!ESUG 2025 Show Us Your Project

We have two "Show us your Project" Sessions, Tuesday and Thursday. The idea is that you can do a mini-presentation or a demo (or both), but it should take 10min max!

There is no deadline, but keep in mind that we are limited by time.

You can pre-register your demo here: *this form>https://app.apptivegrid.de/api/r/6229d48b322a681a3a99ce35/67f7b45d8e77ac5aadeec88e/BDOmRVrRfuAzfyGa0wypMFJ5crFBMrFv4CzCUtMBW54cwIzY8vb1*